SUMMARY:Bush! The Musical
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Finally\, the story audiences have been demanding: a musical co
 medy about the presidency of George W Bush! This riotous original productio
 n – described as 'funny\, ridiculous\, and musically strong satire' (The 
 Cherwell) – follows Bush through his years in the White House\, with bang
 ing tunes and irreverent humour bound to delight all. With his nefarious ne
 mesis Al Gore out to sabotage Bush's hard work at every corner\, how will h
 e lead America and solidify his status in the history books as a thoroughly
  mediocre president?\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event
 /bush-the-musical/
